SUMMARY:Zoo America: Animals in Winter
DESCRIPTION:Save the Date\, Tickets on Sale Soon!!\nZoo America returns to the Lancaster Science Factory with their Animals in Winter presentation on January 16th\, 2027! Shows are all ages and will last about 30 minutes and will include at least 1 live animal. All children must be accompanied by an adult. Learn about how different animals spend the coldest months of the year from migration to hibernation! \nLive animal presentations will take place at 11:00\, 12:00\, 1:30\, and 2:30. \nPresentation tickets are $3 per person in addition to general admission. General admission is required to attend the Zoo America: Animals in Winter presentation (timed entry tickets\, tickets purchased at the door\, membership\, or a free admission program). Lancaster Science Factory members receive 10% off Zoo America show tickets.
URL:https://lancastersciencefactory.org/event/zoo-america-animals-in-winter/
LOCATION:The Lancaster Science Factory\, 454 New Holland Ave\, Lancaster\, PA\, 17602\, United States
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://lancastersciencefactory.org/wp-content/uploads/Zoo-America-1.16.27-Event-Cover.png
GEO:40.0461822;-76.2963319
X-APPLE-STRUCTURED-LOCATION;VALUE=URI;X-ADDRESS=The Lancaster Science Factory 454 New Holland Ave Lancaster PA 17602 United States;X-APPLE-RADIUS=500;X-TITLE=454 New Holland Ave:geo:-76.2963319,40.0461822
END:VEVENT
